# Core kernel only. Wine is not here on purpose: libwine is 725 MiB installed
# (~250 MiB compressed) and cannot fit the 450 MiB ISO budget alongside the
# desktop. It ships in the signed Hypervisor extension instead; see
# docs/architecture/iso-budget.md.
linux-image-amd64
# x86-only GPU and audio firmware. The arm64 image does not need these, so they
# stay out of the shared 00-core list.
firmware-amd-graphics
firmware-nvidia-graphics
firmware-intel-graphics
firmware-intel-sound
firmware-sof-signed
firmware-ipw2x00
